Third-party material used by this project

FER-2013 dataset
  Goodfellow et al., "Challenges in Representation Learning: A report on three
  machine learning contests", ICML 2013 workshop. The training CSV comes from
  the Kaggle mirror deadskull7/fer2013 (listed there as CC0). The dataset is
  not redistributed in this repository.

YuNet face detector (face_detection_yunet_2023mar.onnx)
  From the OpenCV Zoo, https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo, MIT License.
  Downloaded at build time; not stored in this repository.

Test fixture tests/serving/fixtures/face.jpg
  A crop of a NASA astronaut portrait (public domain) distributed with
  scikit-image.
